SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:46:37 and reappears at 18:30:11 IST\, se
 en from Cuttack.\nThe Moon is 24° up in the WSW · daylight\, Sun +0°.\n
 Times against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon
 's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Cuttack
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Cuttack
